WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.179
Ukrainians have taken to the streets

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.249
with arms to defend their country

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.250
and their freedom.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.299
They have prepared Molotov cocktails

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.529
as makeshift bombs.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.309
The threat of tyranny isn't only

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.499
present in the Third World.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.269
In the United States, critics of the

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.129
Second Amendment have claimed

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.079
that in modern warfare, small

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.999
time weapons are useless

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.009
as a check on the power of standing

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.259
armies.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.889
The Tree of Liberty is not water in

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:30.909
the blood of patriots.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.369
What's happened is that there

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:34.989
never been. If you want to think you

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.849
need to have weapons to take

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.069
on the government, you need F-15s

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.719
and maybe some nuclear weapons.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.839
But now Biden is sending small

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.549
arms to Ukraine's front line

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.379
defenders, and it turns out that

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.419
weapons of all sorts can

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.539
help fight off even a nuclear power.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.219
Ukrainian President Volodymyr

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.169
Zelenskyy tweeted he'll give

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:57.999
weapons to anyone who wants

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.589
to defend their country.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:01.419
Ukraine is the only European

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.279
nation where firearms are

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.499
not regulated by a statute.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.329
Even in peacetime, they were

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.429
allowed to carry not fully automatic

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:11.289
rifles and shotguns as

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:13.359
long as they were stored when

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:14.360
not in use.

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:16.989
Ban assault weapons and high

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:19.389
capacity magazines over 100 rounds.

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:23.019
You think the deer wearing Kevlar

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.020
vest?

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.939
No, but unfortunately, hunting

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:29.309
isn't the only purpose of a gun.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:31.289
Horrific war in Ukraine

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.329
reminds us that the right

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:35.189
to bear arms is still

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:36.239
a check on tyranny.

